{"id":"878a95f707ae187c","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-pureliteral.md","title":"Pure literal elimination preserves consistency","display":"thm-pureliteral — Pure literal elimination preserves consistency","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-pureliteral","aliases":["27-thm-pureliteral"],"display":"thm-pureliteral — Pure literal elimination preserves consistency","depends_on":[],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§2.5.2 Monotone literal rules","source_printed_pages":"85","source_pdf_pages":"109","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note","local_review_status":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-pureliteral"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-pureliteral</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-pureliteral — Pure literal elimination preserves consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§2.5.2 Monotone literal rules"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"85"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"109"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formal-interface-reviewed-from-supplied-text"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in[n]\">\\(i\\in[n]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in\\{g,h\\}\\;\\forall a,a&#39;\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((a|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}}=a&#39;|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}})\\Rightarrow u(a)=u(a&#39;))\">\\(\\forall u\\in\\{g,h\\}\\;\\forall a,a&#39;\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((a|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}}=a&#39;|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}})\\Rightarrow u(a)=u(a&#39;))\\)</span>。坐标更新 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a^{i\\gets c}\">\\(a^{i\\gets c}\\)</span>、文字函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell_b:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(\\ell_b:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"a^{i\\gets c}\\coloneqq\\{(j,d)\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land d=c)\\lor(j\\ne i\\land d=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[a^{i\\gets c}\\coloneqq\\{(j,d)\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land d=c)\\lor(j\\ne i\\land d=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a)g(a),h(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a)g(a),h(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(a_i=1-b\\land f(a)=0)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(a_i=1-b\\land f(a)=0)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow f(a^{i\\gets1-b})=0\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow f(a^{i\\gets1-b})=0\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若变量只以同一极性出现，把该文字置零不会增加函数值。由任一解可得到满足固定值的新解，所以该规则保留一致性。它一般不保留所有解；与单位传播的强制固定有本质区别。本页通过明确的不依赖假设保证 g、h 在更改坐标后不变。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in[n]","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"g,h:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall u\\in\\{g,h\\}\\;\\forall a,a'\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;((a|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}}=a'|_{[n]\\setminus\\{i\\}})\\Rightarrow u(a)=u(a'))","display":false},{"tex":"a^{i\\gets c}","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell_b:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B","display":false},{"tex":"a^{i\\gets c}\\coloneqq\\{(j,d)\\in[n]\\times\\mathbb B\\mid(j=i\\land d=c)\\lor(j\\ne i\\land d=a_j)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n,\\ c\\in\\mathbb B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell_b(a)\\coloneqq b a_i+(1-b)(1-a_i),\\qquad f(a)\\coloneqq\\max\\{\\ell_b(a)g(a),h(a)\\}\\quad(a\\in\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;f(a)=0\\right)\\Longleftrightarrow\\left(\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(a_i=1-b\\land f(a)=0)\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;\\left(f(a)=0\\Rightarrow f(a^{i\\gets1-b})=0\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":2024,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-pureliteral|thm-pureliteral — Pure literal elimination preserves consistency]]"}],"outgoing":[]}